# Form 006 Inventory of Equipment layout (Annex A-6)

Source of truth: `Form 006 - Inventory of Equipment.docx` — SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex A-6.
Do not invent columns (serial/location) or portal chrome on the official document.

## Document title

`SETUP Form 006 - Inventory of Equipment`

Mixed case. Do **not** force uppercase via CSS.

## Page

- A4 portrait. Margins: **1 in (25.4 mm)** all sides (Word `pgMar` 1440).
- Body: Arial ~11pt. Black text only (no DOST-blue bars on print/preview document).
- `@page inventory-of-equipment-sheet` footer:

`SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex A-6: SETUP Form 006 - Inventory of Equipment Page ` + `counter(page)` / `counter(pages)`

## Structure (exact Word order)

1. Title
2. Project Title / Project Cooperator (underlined value lines)
3. Table: caption row `INVENTORY OF ACQUIRED EQUIPMENT (SETUP FUNDED)`
4. Column headers: QTY | Name of Equipment/ Description/ Specification | AMOUNT | PROPERTY No. (stacked) | DATE ACQUIRED | REMARKS
5. At least 5 data rows (pad blank); grow if more inventory rows
6. TOTAL row (label in description column; sum in AMOUNT)
7. Signatures: Inventory Conducted by (Regional Office Representative) + Date; Witnessed by (Cooperator/Authorized Representative)

Column width ratios from Word `gridCol` twips: `923 | 2154 | 1269 | 1596 | 1904 | 1390`.

## Preview vs print (100% fidelity)

- Preview **mounts** `InventoryOfEquipmentDocument` — same markup as print. Not an approximate portal table.
- Print re-renders via `createRoot` (`printInventoryOfEquipmentPdf`). Do **not** clone `#inventory-of-equipment-preview`.
- No logo / Republic header / Application ID on the official document.

## Print path

In-page `window.print()` to `#inventory-of-equipment-print-root` + `body.inventory-of-equipment-printing`. Do not use popup `document.write`.

